  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ecuador: Debt for Nature Swap in Galapagos</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Delivery of technical assistance to the Ministry of Economy and Finance of Ecuador to develop the systems and capacity to issue thematic bonds and implement debt for climate swap transactions.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Main deliverables include:- establishment of bond committee - development of Blue Bond Framework - development of Concept Note: Performance Bond- development of Debt for Climate Swap roadmap</narrative>
  </description>
